  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"5a80ce85-2d02-f444-8dc8-98ae7d1c79e7"],
 "\[LineSeparator]will prompt to select the *.bval and *.bvec files. \n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"340b6af4-abee-7f4f-bfda-a2ada1fccb54"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["ImportBvalvec",
